  "details": "I have been testing repeatedly over different avatars after getting Index controllers last week.\n \nI think this problem has been mentioned but sunk to the bottom not fixed nor getting noticed. \nWhen using the Vive controllers the head viewpoint is following almost perfectly with the avatar, I have checked this is not the problem with SDK 2/3 ( but could be caused by it). I have friends noticed this problem when they sit down that the viewpoint sinks into the body, making them to work around messing with the viewpoint but the problem still exist. \nPlease help to vote up if you see the same problem as I do.",
